es sequences of any given length (we will omit this proof, too)."}],"kind":"container"}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"You are given a balanced parentheses sequence. Find its preimage: the balanced parentheses sequence the balanced shuffle of which is equal to the given sequence."}],"kind":"container"}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"input_specification"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The only line of input contains a string $$$s$$$ consisting only of characters \""},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"("}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"\" and \""},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":")"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"\". This string is guaranteed to be a non-empty balanced parentheses sequence with its "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"length not exceeding $$$1\\,000$$$"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"output_specification"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Print the balanced parentheses sequence $$$t$$$ such that the balanced shuffle of $$$t$$$ is equal to $$$s$$$. It is guaranteed that the answer always exists and is unique."}],"kind":"container"}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"samples"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Example"}],"kind":"heading"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample"},"children":[{"attrs":{"role":"sample_input"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"\n()(()())\n"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample_output"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","te